# Red Ward's "red" is a color word of its text (CR 612.1, 702.16): Bot1's Sleight of Mind changes it to green, so the
# Devoted Hero it enchants has protection from green and no longer from red (CR 612.2), and the Aura, white, stays.
# Bot2 then cannot target the Hero with Rancor, a green Aura spell (the refusal; had the word stayed red the spell
# would be legal), while on turn 4 the same spell enchants Bot1's Llanowar Elves (the positive control: the spell
# works, only the Hero is protected).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Devoted Hero
Red Ward
Sleight of Mind
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Rancor
Forest x12

